        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Where the packs are made.",
            "tag": "h2",
            "size_desktop": 48,
            "size_mobile": 34
          }
        },
        "subheading": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A treated room with a desk, two monitors, a few drum machines and a tape machine we use for textures. Big enough for two people and a guitar.</p><p>We write a finished track with every pack before it goes on sale. If a sound does not make it into a track, it does not make it into the pack.</p>",
            "size_desktop": 17,
            "size_mobile": 15
          }
        },
